<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013300744/device-tp.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" style="width: 680px; height: 70px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2022470185/180312_QBR+SME+Non+product.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" alt="Qantas Business Rewards" width="680" height="453" style="width: 680px; height: 453px;"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">An update from Qantas Business Rewards</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear [ team to insert "QBR Account holder" ],</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We were in touch recently with {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName} who confirmed they've been flying regularly with Qantas on behalf of your company.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We've passed on your contact details so they can get in touch with you regarding any questions about the account, including having their traveller profile added.</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Making your ABN as natural as ABC</b><br>We want to make sure your business is getting all the rewards it's entitled to as part of your Qantas Business Rewards membership.<br><br>And that means ensuring your ABN is added to any eligible flight your employees take, which in turn earns your business and the employee Qantas Points<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">1</sup>&nbsp;for the very same flight. It's a win-win, in other words. Your ABN is the key to accessing rewards and savings with Qantas Business Rewards.<br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Managing your account</b><br>You can add travellers to your Qantas Business Rewards account, as well as payment details and other access permissions, like being able to book flights with the Qantas App.<br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Using a travel agent?</b><br>No problem. Just make sure they have your company ABN and Traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer number to enter into all Qantas bookings.</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/saved-travellers" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/saved-travellers" target="_blank" alt="Manage your account" title="Manage your account" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; line-height: 16px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Manage your account</font></a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/saved-travellers" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><b>Like to know more?</b><br>If you have any questions or need more information:</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Contact Qantas Business Rewards on 13 74 78</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Visit&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantasbusinessrewards.com</a></font></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br>Sincerely,<br>Your Qantas Business Rewards Team</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 45px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 23px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 23px; margin: 0px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">1. A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member and registered for GST or be an Australian Public or Private entity or other incorporated company, and not be a travel agent or on a Corporate Deal with Qantas to earn Qantas Points for the business. Qantas Points for business are offered under the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlineterms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas' Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points earned on air travel are determined in accordance with the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/airlineearntable" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">airline earn table</a>. A Member's ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number must be quoted at the time of booking to earn Qantas Points for both the business and the traveller. An eligible flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; is operated by Qantas, Emirates or American Airlines; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br><br><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>